# Purpose
Provides a checklist for reviewing document content, formatting, links,
references, calculations, and sensitive information.

# Key Sections
- Before you start.
- Content checks.
- Formatting checks.
- Link and reference checks.
- Data and calculation checks.
- Sensitive information check.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Review should call out uncertainty and avoid treating unchecked information as
  verified.

